:"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.陳醫師這麼做，可能帶來哪些好處？（請打勾，複選）","n":26,"ssz":"................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓家屬感受到醫療團隊願意理解自己。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓家屬以為醫師認為所有民俗作法都能治病。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓家屬更願意和醫療團隊溝通、聽取建議。","n":19,"ssz":"......1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓家屬有機會表達對病人的關心與不捨。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、生活中也會遇到文化差異","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.不同的宗教信仰","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"班上舉行祭拜活動，一位同學因為宗教信仰不同，不參加祭拜。","n":28,"ssz":".........1....1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶先了解什麼？（單選）","n":11,"ssz":"..1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他不參加，是因為不尊重班級。","n":14,"ssz":".......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不同信仰可能有不同的習俗與規定。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷怎麼做比較合適？（單選）","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尊重他的選擇，讓他用其他方式表達對班級的關心。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要求他和大家做完全一樣的事。","n":14,"ssz":"1..1.....1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.不同的飲食文化","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"新住民同學帶來有家鄉香料味的便當，有人說：「味道好奇怪！」","n":29,"ssz":"........................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他故意帶奇怪的食物來引起注意。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不同家庭與文化可能有不同的飲食習慣。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"叫他以後不要再帶家裡準備的食物。","n":16,"ssz":"....1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不嘲笑別人的食物，也可以友善地了解食物的特色。","n":23,"ssz":"...............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.不同族群的重要祭典","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一位原住民族同學要參加部落的重要祭典，因此依規定請假。","n":27,"ssz":".........................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祭典對族群的文化傳承可能具有重要意義。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他只是想找理由不來學校上課。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尊重同學參與祭典，也依照學校規定辦理請假。","n":21,"ssz":".....1.............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所有人都應過完全一樣的節日，這樣才公平。","n":20,"ssz":"........1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎把理解與尊重帶著走","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到和自己不同的信仰、習慣或生活方式時，我會提醒自己：","n":27,"ssz":"..1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自填，原